      <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
        <name>WithoutCalculation</name>
        <id>16</id>
        <title>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Rebate amount is calculated outside the system
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>مبلغ تخفیف برگشتی خارج از سیستم محاسبه می‌شود
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Сумма бонуса рассчитывается вне системы
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Bonus tutarı, sistemin dışında hesaplanır
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Số tiền thưởng được tính bên ngoài hệ thống
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Rebate amount is calculated outside the system
</value>
        </title>
        <title>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Rebate amount is calculated outside the system
</value>
        </title>
        <visible>true</visible>
        <enabled>true</enabled>
        <userVisible>
          <common>true</common>
        </userVisible>
        <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
          <segments>Object.WithoutCalculation</segments>
        </dataPath>
        <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
        <toolTip>
          <key>en</key>
          <value>Total rebate amount to accrue is specified in the &quot;Conditions of customer rebates&quot; document.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>fa</key>
          <value>کل مبلغ تخفیف برگشتی قابل محاسبه در سند «شرایط تخفیف‌های برگشتی مشتری» مشخص می‌شود.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>ru</key>
          <value>Итоговая сумма бонуса к начислению указывается в документе &quot;Условия ретро-бонусов клиентов&quot;.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>tr</key>
          <value>Tahakkuk edilecek toplam bonus miktarı, &quot;“Müşteri retro bonus şartları&quot; belgesinde belirtilmiştir.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>vi</key>
          <value>Tổng số tiền thưởng cần tính được chỉ định trong chứng từ &quot;Điều kiện thưởng lũy kế cho khách hàng&quot;.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>it</key>
          <value>Total rebate amount to accrue is specified in the &quot;Conditions of customer rebates&quot; document.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTip>
          <key>pl</key>
          <value>Total rebate amount to accrue is specified in the &quot;Conditions of customer rebates&quot; document.</value>
        </toolTip>
        <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
        <handlers>
          <event>OnChange</event>
          <name>WithoutCalculationOnChange</name>
        </handlers>
